  {
   "id": 22,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    40,
    60
   ],
   "size": [
    460,
    762
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 21,
   "mode": 0,
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# New outfit colours or a skin variant\n**VTube Pro workflow, 16 GB graphics card** (Z-Image-Turbo + FLUX.2 klein 4B). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nA recolour or restyle of a texture (a winter jacket, a red version) that still fits your model.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Load the texture in \"Your texture\".\n2. Say the change in words, like \"make the jacket dark green wool\".\n3. Press Run. Try a few times and keep the best.\n4. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** A PNG the same size as the original texture.\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Add it as a new costume or texture set (the Costumes tab, or import_costume for AIs). Never overwrite the original.\n\n**Settings:** 4 steps, CFG 1.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein) (7.8 GB) in `models/diffusion_models`: Apache-2.0 (the 4B only; FLUX.2 klein 9B is non-commercial)\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo) (8.0 GB) in `models/text_encoders`: Apache-2.0\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein) (0.3 GB) in `models/vae`: Apache-2.0\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro outfit variant workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- Name what must not change: \"keep the emblem and every seam\".\n- Picture size stays the same as the original, so it fits your model.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
 ],
